(defparameter *faqs*
  '((:question "What services do you offer?"
     :answer "At Shinite Cleaning Services, we offer a comprehensive range of professional solutions, including Apartment Cleaning, Office Cleaning, Deep Cleaning, Construction Cleaning, Move-in/Move-out Cleaning and Residential Cleaning.")
    
    (:question "Do I need to provide my own cleaning supplies and equipment?"
     :answer "Not at all! We arrive fully equipped with premium, professional-grade cleaning supplies and equipment. However, if you have specific products you would prefer us to use, we are always happy to accommodate.")
    
    (:question "How do I know if I need a Deep Cleaning instead of a standard clean?"
     :answer "If it has been a few months since your space had a thorough scrub, or if you are preparing to host an event, a Deep Clean is ideal. It targets neglected areas like baseboards, window tracks, and heavy dust buildup.")
    
    (:question "Will I have the same cleaner every time?"
     :answer "If you prefer? Yes! We strive to send the same trusted cleaning professional to your home or office for every scheduled visit. This ensures consistent quality and allows our team to learn your exact preferences.")
    
    (:question "What is the process for getting started?"
     :answer "It's completely hassle-free. Simply reach out to us for a free estimate. We will discuss your specific space, outline your cleaning goals, and build a customized schedule that fits your life.")
    
    (:question "How much do your cleaning services cost?"
     :answer "Our rates are based on the size of your property, the type of service requested, and the frequency of visits. Contact us today for a transparent, no-obligation quote tailored to your budget.")
    
    (:question "Are your cleaners insured and background-checked?"
     :answer "Absolutely. Your peace of mind and the security of your property are our top priorities. Every professional at Shinite Cleaning Services is fully insured, bonded, and rigorously background-checked.")
    
    (:question "Do I need to be home while you clean?"
     :answer "That is entirely up to you! Many of our clients prefer to leave a key or entry code so they can return to a sparkling clean space after a long day, but you are always welcome to be present while we work.")))
